#: templates/pages/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Afrikai Hajfonás (“we”, “us”) respects your privacy and is committed to "
"protecting your personal data in line with the EU General Data Protection "
"Regulation (GDPR). This policy explains what we collect, why, and the rights"
" you have over your information."
msgstr ""
"Afrikai Hajfonás (“we”, “us”) respects your privacy and is committed to "
"protecting your personal data in line with the EU General Data Protection "
"Regulation (GDPR). This policy explains what we collect, why, and the rights"
" you have over your information."

