#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid "Choose from available slots based on the stylist"
msgstr "Choose from available slots based on the stylist"

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid "Share your details & photos"
msgstr "Share your details & photos"

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid ""
"Provide your contact details and clear hair photos so we can assess "
"suitability."
msgstr ""
"Provide your contact details and clear hair photos so we can assess "
"suitability."

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid "Send your deposit"
msgstr "Send your deposit"

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid ""
"Transfer the deposit and upload your proof of payment using your reference "
"code (AFH-XXXXXX)."
msgstr ""
"Transfer the deposit and upload your proof of payment using your reference "
"code (AFH-XXXXXX)."

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid ""
"We then verify your deposit and review your hair photos. You will receive a "
"confirmation once your appointment is approved. You can check your status "
"anytime via the booking status lookup."
msgstr ""
"We then verify your deposit and review your hair photos. You will receive a "
"confirmation once your appointment is approved. You can check your status "
"anytime via the booking status lookup."

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid "Photo Submission Policy"
msgstr "Photo Submission Policy"

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid ""
"To assess whether your hair suits the chosen style, we ask for three photos:"
" front, side, and back. These help us confirm length, texture, and thickness"
" before you commit."
msgstr ""
"To assess whether your hair suits the chosen style, we ask for three photos:"
" front, side, and back. These help us confirm length, texture, and thickness"
" before you commit."

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid ""
"Accepted formats: JPG, JPEG, PNG, and WEBP, up to 5 MB per photo. Photos are"
" reviewed only by our team and stored securely. See our Privacy Policy for "
"how your images are handled."
msgstr ""
"Accepted formats: JPG, JPEG, PNG, and WEBP, up to 5 MB per photo. Photos are"
" reviewed only by our team and stored securely. See our Privacy Policy for "
"how your images are handled."

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid ""
"Proof of payment (a screenshot of your bank transfer) may be uploaded as "
"JPG, JPEG, PNG, or PDF, up to 5 MB."
msgstr ""
"Proof of payment (a screenshot of your bank transfer) may be uploaded as "
"JPG, JPEG, PNG, or PDF, up to 5 MB."

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid "Cancellation Policy"
msgstr "Cancellation Policy"

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid ""
"If you need to cancel, please contact us as early as possible. Because "
"braiding appointments reserve several hours of a stylist"
msgstr ""
"If you need to cancel, please contact us as early as possible. Because "
"braiding appointments reserve several hours of a stylist"

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid "If we decline your request, your deposit is refunded in full."
msgstr "If we decline your request, your deposit is refunded in full."

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid ""
"If your request expires (no action within 12 hours), it is moved to our "
"refund queue for processing."
msgstr ""
"If your request expires (no action within 12 hours), it is moved to our "
"refund queue for processing."

#: templates/pages/terms.html
msgid ""
"No-shows or late cancellations of approved appointments may forfeit the "
"deposit."
msgstr ""
"No-shows or late cancellations of approved appointments may forfeit the "
"deposit."

